sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant Server as autogluonserver<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant AG as AutoGluon Predictor<br/>(in-process)

    Note over Client,AG: Flow 1: Model Loading at Startup

    Server->>+Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 | IAM/SA credentials
    Storage-->>-Server: Model files (via kserve-storage SDK)
    Server->>FS: Write to local model directory
    Server->>Server: predictor_factory.py<br/>Auto-detect: try TimeSeriesPredictor,<br/>fallback to TabularPredictor
    Server->>Server: version_compat.py<br/>Validate major.minor match,<br/>tolerate patch/+rhaiv.N mismatch
    Server->>AG: Load predictor into memory

    Note over Client,AG: Flow 2: Tabular Inference (v2 Protocol)

    Client->>+KRBP: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTPS/8443 | Bearer Token
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate token<br/>(platform RBAC policy)
    KRBP->>+Server: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>HTTP/8080 (plaintext localhost)
    Server->>Server: Decode InferRequest tensor<br/>→ numpy array → pandas DataFrame
    Server->>+AG: TabularPredictor.predict(df)
    AG-->>-Server: Prediction results (Series/DataFrame)
    Server->>Server: Encode response → InferResponse tensor
    Server-->>-KRBP: 200 OK + InferResponse JSON
    KRBP-->>-Client: 200 OK + InferResponse JSON<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.3

    Note over Client,AG: Flow 3: Time Series Inference (v1 Protocol)

    Client->>+KRBP: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>HTTPS/8443 | Bearer Token
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate token
    KRBP->>+Server: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>HTTP/8080 (plaintext localhost)
    Server->>Server: Parse JSON with instances<br/>+ optional known_covariates
    Server->>Server: Build DataFrame with<br/>item_id + timestamp columns
    Server->>+AG: TimeSeriesPredictor.predict(<br/>  data=df,<br/>  known_covariates=covariates_df)
    AG-->>-Server: Forecast DataFrame<br/>(mean, quantiles)
    Server->>Server: Convert forecast → JSON dict
    Server-->>-KRBP: 200 OK + predictions JSON
    KRBP-->>-Client: 200 OK + predictions JSON<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.3

    Note over Client,AG: Optional: predict_proba (Tabular v1)

    Client->>+KRBP: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>PREDICT_PROBA=true
    KRBP->>+Server: Proxy request
    Server->>+AG: TabularPredictor.predict_proba(df)
    AG-->>-Server: Class probability DataFrame
    Server-->>-KRBP: 200 OK + probabilities
    KRBP-->>-Client: 200 OK + probabilities
